# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# Cloud box: the owner reaches it over the internet, so SSH (key-only, board sshd_config) and the HTTPS
# gateway answer from any address. Everything else stays LAN/mesh-only (host.nft). Rescue 7443 and the
# Headscale join port stay LAN-only; the mesh port 41641/udp is open so direct mesh paths can form.
# SSH goes through the "ssh" chain, not a plain accept: the 6-new-connections-a-minute limit then applies to the internet
# too, and port 22 closes again when sshd is switched off (the chain is empty while it is stopped).
add rule inet onemind_host input tcp dport 22 jump ssh
add rule inet onemind_host input tcp dport { 443, 8443 } accept
add rule inet onemind_host input udp dport 41641 accept
